ed Thorns.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1180122-ex3-social-system-cheat-sheet-and-flowchart\" target=\"_blank\">My Ex3 Social System Cheat Sheet</a>","edited":{"userid":23767,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23767-redthorn","user":"Redthorn","date":". 02-14-2019, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":20}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23767-redthorn","name":"Redthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-28T08:18:19-08:00","id":1180169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Redthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1180122-ex3-social-system-cheat-sheet-and-flowchart#post1180122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi there, I thought I'd make my first post here something productive, so here it is.<br /> <br /> Inspired by <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/766048-ex3-i-made-a-1-page-combat-flowchart\">GivenFlesh's combat flowchart</a>, I decided to give the social system a similar treatment:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.filedropper.com/ex3socialcolour\" target=\"_blank\">File Dropper</a> (2 Pages, Colour)<br /> <br /> Due to my inexperience with the programs I used to make the sheet, you'll have to print at 97% size to fit the printout onto A4. If that can be fixed, I'd be glad to know.<br /> Apologies to anyone with colour blindness, I'll look into making a B&amp;W version in the future as this one doesn't come out too well.<br /> Yes, I'm using UK English spellings - force of habit.<br /> <br /> Any feedback would be great, I'll try to keep this updated as best I can.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh you <i>blessed</i> person. That's quite a first post. Kudos to you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-28T09:41:48-08:00","id":1180189,"title":"","content":"very nice<br /> <br /> this'll be handy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T04:54:12-08:00","id":1180386,"title":"","content":"Fantastic, thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_li